# armour/tiles/stitch: the leather bracer's stitch line on the forearm region (F): a step-1 row every second row
# (matte leather, no shine).
# Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h; `on-region` is P2C_CONTRACTS 4 (the regions after the word).
use person
body adult
role overlay stitch
tags tile overlay
on-region F

view D key rest origin 0 0
|h
|g

